  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Tinker sphere ((computation) package).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may transfer routines you craft into gizmos created by others, constructs with the robot subtype, and any technological item which uses charges. If a robot has an AI routine installed in this way, it gains the aggregate template for as long as the AI remains installed. A robot must be willing or helpless for you to transfer an AI routine into it. A robot’s effective gizmo level is equal to its CR, while a technological item’s effective gizmo level is equal to the item’s Craft DC -15.</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> This feat may not be acceptable for all campaigns. Consult with your GM before taking this feat.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gizmo-feats#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
